OL,5,G0110 24 Hours in A&E
OL,6,     FMotorcyclist Brendan has had a
OL,7,     Fhead-on collision with a car.
OL,8,     FTeenager Alex has badly injured
OL,9,     Fhis hand punching a window. And
OL,10,     Fthe resus team struggle to revive
OL,11,     Ftwo patients.
OL,12,G0215 24 Hours in A&E
OL,13,     FCharlie, who's 65, is back for the
OL,14,     Fsecond time in two weeks after
OL,15,     Fpreviously being discharged
OL,16,     Ffollowing a crash. And Peggy,
OL,17,     Fwho's 89, is rushed in with a
OL,18,     Fsuspected stroke.
